Recommends: libreoffice-core
Description: desktop chat client for OpenAI-compatible local backends
 Shammy is a Qt 6 desktop chat client for Ollama, llama.cpp server,
 LM Studio, vLLM, and other OpenAI-compatible /v1 backends. It
 streams completions, manages conversations and projects, runs local
 MCP tools, and previews HTML and SVG artifacts.
